<section xmlns="http://xml.house.gov/schemas/uslm/1.0" style="-uslm-lc:I80" id="id6c2f8f3b-86b3-11f1-8c1e-ca5e0ea6b57b" identifier="/us/usc/t15/s5307"><num value="5307">§ 5307.</num><heading> Authorization of appropriations</heading><content>
<p style="-uslm-lc:I11" class="indent0">There are authorized to be appropriated to the Secretary for carrying out this chapter $5,000,000 for each of the fiscal years 1991, 1992, 1993, 1994, 1995, 1996, and 1997, to be derived from such sums as are otherwise authorized under <ref href="/us/usc/t42/s13451/e">section 13451(e) of title 42</ref>.</p>
</content><sourceCredit id="id6c2f8f3c-86b3-11f1-8c1e-ca5e0ea6b57b">(<ref href="/us/pl/101/425/s8">Pub. L. 101–425, § 8</ref>, <date date="1990-10-15">Oct. 15, 1990</date>, <ref href="/us/stat/104/919">104 Stat. 919</ref>; <ref href="/us/pl/102/486/tXXI/s2106/b">Pub. L. 102–486, title XXI, § 2106(b)</ref>, <date date="1992-10-24">Oct. 24, 1992</date>, <ref href="/us/stat/106/3070">106 Stat. 3070</ref>.)</sourceCredit>
<notes type="uscNote" id="id6c2f8f3d-86b3-11f1-8c1e-ca5e0ea6b57b">
<note style="-uslm-lc:I74" role="crossHeading" topic="editorialNotes" id="id6c2f8f3e-86b3-11f1-8c1e-ca5e0ea6b57b"><heading class="centered"><b>Editorial Notes</b></heading></note>
<note style="-uslm-lc:I74" topic="amendments" id="id6c2f8f3f-86b3-11f1-8c1e-ca5e0ea6b57b"><heading class="centered smallCaps">Amendments</heading><p style="-uslm-lc:I21" class="indent0">1992—<ref href="/us/pl/102/486">Pub. L. 102–486</ref> substituted “1993, 1994, 1995, 1996, and 1997, to be derived from such sums as are otherwise authorized under <ref href="/us/usc/t42/s13451/e">section 13451(e) of title 42</ref>” for “and 1993”.</p>
</note>
